    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDelaney Estates are delighted to present No. 7 Gandon Mews, an attractive two-bedroom mid-terrace townhouse ideally positioned in the heart of Lucan Village.\nOffering bright, well-proportioned accommodation together with the added benefit of a private south-facing rear garden, this property represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers or those seeking a conveniently located home close to an extensive range of amenities.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, spacious living room, kitchen/dining room with direct access to the rear garden, two generous double bedrooms and a family bathroom. There is also useful understairs storage and attic access.\n\nThe living room is a comfortable and well-proportioned space featuring laminate timber flooring and a marble and timber fireplace with gas fire. To the rear, the kitchen/dining room is fitted with a range of kitchen units, integrated oven and hob, and opens directly onto the private south-facing garden.\n\nUpstairs are two spacious double bedrooms, both benefiting from fitted wardrobes, together with the family bathroom.\n\nThe private rear garden is a particularly appealing feature of the property. Measuring approximately 6.18m x 4.15m and enjoying a desirable southerly orientation, it provides an excellent outdoor space with the benefit of sunshine throughout much of the day.\n\nGandon Mews enjoys an exceptionally convenient village setting, just a short stroll from the cafés, restaurants, shops and amenities of Lucan Village. A wide selection of schools, parks, sporting facilities and public transport services are also within easy reach.\n\nThe property is well positioned for access to the N4/M4, M50 and M7 road networks, while Liffey Valley Shopping Centre and Ballyowen Shopping Centre are also within proximity.\n\nNo. 7 offers buyers an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-located home with the potential to personalise and enhance to their own taste.\n\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Hall\nApprox. 1.58m x 1.00m.\n\nLiving Room\nApprox. 4.40m x 3.78m.\nBright and spacious living room with laminate timber flooring and marble and timber fireplace incorporating a gas fire.\n\nUnderstairs Storage\nApprox. 1.90m x 0.84m.\n\nKitchen / Dining Room\nApprox. 4.08m x 3.78m.\nLaminate timber flooring, fitted kitchen units and integrated oven and hob. Direct access to the south-facing rear garden.\n\nBedroom 1\nApprox. 3.31m x 2.64m.\nDouble bedroom with fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2\nApprox. 3.77m x 3.16m.\nGenerous double bedroom with fitted wardrobes.\n\nBathroom\nApprox. 2.69m x 1.68m.\nFitted with WC, wash hand basin and bath with shower attachment. Laminate timber flooring.\n\nRear Garden\nApprox. 6.18m x 4.15m.\nPrivate south-facing rear garden.\n\nViewing is highly recommended!\n\n"
      },
      {
